<title>USA: IMM currency futures mixed, June yen turns higher.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures mixed, June yen turns higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 14 - IMM currency futures were mixed in morning trading, with June marks and Swiss lower but at session highs. June yen turned higher. Yen popped above resistance at $0.008500 to reach $0.008502. Cap now seen at $0.008545, trader said. June marks near resistance at $0.5900.</p>
